== Guide overview: ordinal vs surreal (natural) sum ==
ok   ordinal: 1 + ω = ω, ω + 1 ≠ ω
ok   natural (surreal) sum is commutative and 1 ⊕ ω = ω + 1 ≠ ω, so 1 + ω = ω does not transfer
